     "content_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\" - 6x \\ge 18\"></span></td>\n<td>This is the correct answer.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{ - 6x}}{{ - 6}} \\le \\frac{{18}}{{ - 6}}\"></span></td>\n<td>Divide by –6 and switch the sign because you divided by a negative number.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"x \\le  - 3\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\left( {-\\infty ,-3} \\right)\"></span></td>\n<td>This is interval notation.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
